      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The Stayers Cup now where REMADOSI (6) makes the most appeal. She just missed two back without much luck and was out-gunned close to home last start. Out to 1900m is a big tick for her as she looks set to raise the bar. Can blend in at the right time and go one better now. BOMBELLEISTIC (2) edged out REMADOSI last start in a tough finish with those two clear of the rest. He loses Loy, but gets JVO instead and maps to get every chance once again out in trip. Last two wins here have been super and he's the main danger. SUNBURNT COUNTRY (8) just couldn't sprint with them last start when settling behind the pair, ending up 1.3L off BOMBELLEISTIC. Should sit closer this time from an inside draw. Jumped favourite last start and can turn the tables. COUNTY KILKENNY (1) went back-to-back last start at Wagga. Firmer deck here but he can make every post a winner once again.",
